  Border: 749456
  Color: BAFF79
  Emoji: Assets/Resources/images/dark/a16_emoji-zoo-eyes.png
  FX: Assets/Resources/images/dark/a16_darkInfoFXElectricWhite.png
  Title: 'Dealer Update! '
  Details: Welcome to the Dealer Job Pack!
  BulletPointEmoji:
  BulletPoints:
  - '<color=#BAFF79>In this job pack, you''ll join a cartel, deal their products on your assigned street, and work your way up to becoming king(or queen)pin! As you rank up in the cartel, you''ll unlock different activities, so explore and be the best hustler this side of Miami.</color>\n\n<align="center">What to do in this update:      <color=#000000>.</color></align>'
  - '<color=#BAFF79>Push products on your street! </color>Once you gain complete Control of your street as a Dealer, you''ll <color=#BAFF79>rank up to Runner</color>!'
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_Dealer_Turf
  - \n<color=#BAFF79>Go on drug runs</color> to acquire more product for your cartel to <color=#BAFF79>process and push</color>!
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_Dealer_SupplyRun
  - \n<color=#BAFF79>Manufacture your own drug cuts </color>once you rank up to Manufacturer!
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_Dealer_Manufacture
  - \nCause your fellow cartel members to join you in <color=#BAFF79>overthrowing the kingpin</color> as a lieutenant and they might choose you as their next leader!
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_Dealer_Mutiny
  - \n<color=#BAFF79>Start a Gang War as a kingpin and watch your cartel grow</color>!
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_Dealer_GangWar
  WrappedVideo: 0
